These sit beside today's worst ulp and worst class, as extra columns, so a status question or the Function Bank page never needs a special full run. Keep the classes as calc-verdict's Severity defines them. Optionally add one worst-case example per function (args and expected/actual bits). docs/fun/tools/refresh_function_bank.py and the page's conformance table then show the counts per class.
